        78.81909942626953,
        139.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        126.56519317626953,
        526.9531860351562,
        139.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "Evaluate the impact of LC-mNAAT testing on patient-important outcomes (cure, mortality,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        142.065185546875,
        324.5938415527344,
        155.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "time to diagnosis and time to start of treatment).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.565185546875,
        78.81909942626953,
        170.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        157.565185546875,
        526.7532348632812,
        170.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "Evaluate the effect of sample concentration approaches (e.g. centrifugation) and volume on",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.970410346984863,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        173.065185546875,
        524.4236450195312,
        186.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "the performance of LC-mNAAT technologies, including in extrapulmonary TB sample types.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.990145683288574,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        188.565185546875,
        78.81909942626953,
        201.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        188.565185546875,
        526.7869873046875,
        201.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "Evaluate the impact on incremental accuracy and case detection of alternative sample types",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.977726936340332,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        204.065185546875,
        204.9925994873047,
        217.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "that are easier to collect.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        219.565185546875,
        78.81909942626953,
        232.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        219.565185546875,
        383.21148681640625,
        232.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "Develop a test in this class that can detect TB drug resistance.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        235.065185546875,
        78.81909942626953,
        248.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        235.065185546875,
        519.6533203125,
        248.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "Review the field performance of the current technologies used in programmatic settings.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        250.565185546875,
        78.81909942626953,
        263.710205078125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        250.565185546875,
        523.041015625,
        263.710205078125
      ],
      "text": "Conduct operational research to ensure that tests are used optimally in intended settings.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        266.065185546875,
        78.81909942626953,
        279.210205078125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        266.065185546875,
        527.04345703125,
        279.210205078125
      ],
      "text": "Evaluate the different classes of tests, including LC-mNAATs, to determine which classes",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        281.565185546875,
        526.9664306640625,
        294.710205078125
      ],
      "text": "or testing strategies yield superior diagnostic accuracy, cost–effectiveness and impact on",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        297.065185546875,
        204.74041748046875,
        310.210205078125
      ],
      "text": "equity and acceptability.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        312.565185546875,
        78.81909942626953,
        325.710205078125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        312.565185546875,
        527.0877685546875,
        325.710205078125
      ],
      "text": "Identify an improved reference standard that accurately defines TB disease in children,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        328.0652160644531,
        526.9312744140625,
        341.2102355957031
      ],
      "text": "paucibacillary specimens and people who cannot produce sputum, because the sensitivity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        343.5652160644531,
        283.5205993652344,
        356.7102355957031
      ],
      "text": "of all available diagnostics is suboptimal.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        359.0652160644531,
        78.81909942626953,
        372.2102355957031
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        359.0652160644531,
        527.2008056640625,
        372.2102355957031
      ],
      "text": "Assess the budget impact and cost–effectiveness of LC-mNAATs compared with other classes",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.949734687805176,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        374.5652160644531,
        123.16509246826172,
        387.7102355957031
      ],
      "text": "of tests.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        390.0652160644531,
        78.81909942626953,
        403.2102355957031
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        390.0652160644531,
        526.9641723632812,
        403.2102355957031
      ],
      "text": "Develop and apply standardized methods for assessment of costs and cost–effectiveness,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        405.5652160644531,
        373.30084228515625,
        418.7102355957031
      ],
      "text": "to improve comparability and scope of economic evidence.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        438.0561218261719,
        498.1494445800781,
        460.2861022949219
      ],
      "text": "2.3. Concurrent use of initial diagnostic tests for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        460.8561096191406,
        470.5728759765625,
        483.0860900878906
      ],
      "text": "diagnosis of TB in People living with HIV and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        483.6561279296875,
        142.59490966796875,
        505.8861083984375
      ],
      "text": "children",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        514.97705078125,
        526.8796997070312,
        528.1220703125
      ],
      "text": "There are significant burdens of tuberculosis in people living with HIV and children, particularly",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.977076530456543,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        530.47705078125,
        526.6739501953125,
        543.6220703125
      ],
      "text": "in low- and middle-income countries (LMICs). Persons living with HIV are at substantially higher",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.970660209655762,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        545.97705078125,
        526.9285278320312,
        559.1220703125
      ],
      "text": "risk of developing TB disease due to immunosuppression, with TB being a leading cause of death",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        561.47705078125,
        526.9645385742188,
        574.6220703125
      ],
      "text": "among this population. Children, especially those under five, are at high risk of progression",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        576.9769897460938,
        526.969970703125,
        590.1220092773438
      ],
      "text": "from TB infection to TB disease and rapid disease progression and often present with broad",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        592.4769897460938,
        527.2918701171875,
        605.6220092773438
      ],
      "text": "respiratory symptoms, which complicate diagnosis and increase morbidity and mortality if not",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.997249603271484,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        607.9769897460938,
        526.9644775390625,
        621.1220092773438
      ],
      "text": "promptly treated. Addressing TB in these at-risk populations requires concerted efforts that",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        623.4769897460938,
        404.9852600097656,
        636.6220092773438
      ],
      "text": "account for their unique clinical presentations and diagnostic needs.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        647.4808959960938,
        526.93701171875,
        660.6259155273438
      ],
      "text": "Diagnosing TB in persons living with HIV and children is challenging, particularly because of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        662.9808959960938,
        526.965576171875,
        676.1259155273438
      ],
      "text": "unspecific clinical presentations and often low and varying numbers of mycobacteria in their",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        678.4808959960938,
        527.0352783203125,
        691.6259155273438
      ],
      "text": "samples that lower the sensitivity of existing diagnostic tests. Furthermore, children and people",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.967903137207031,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        693.9808959960938,
        526.7279663085938,
        707.1259155273438
      ],
      "text": "living with HIV with advanced immunosuppression may be unable to provide sputum samples",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.993898391723633,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        709.4808959960938,
        526.91943359375,
        722.6259155273438
      ],
      "text": "and can have disseminated TB, which is challenging to confirm with laboratory methods. To, in",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.984589576721191,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        724.9808959960938,
        526.8099975585938,
        738.1259155273438
      ],
      "text": "part address this challenge, WHO recommends the use of stool to aid in laboratory confirmation",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.946369171142578,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        740.4808959960938,
        527.0844116210938,
        753.6259155273438
      ],
      "text": "of TB in children, and the use of urine to aid in the confirmation of TB in persons living with HIV.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.975221633911133,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        755.9808959960938,
        526.9592895507812,
        769.1259155273438
      ],
      "text": "However, even highly sensitive tests for TB diagnosis, such as LC-aNAATs, can miss TB in these",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        40.76240158081055,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "48 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}